      <category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/godailyquestion/">GoDailyQuestion</category>
      <category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/golanguagebasics/">GoLanguageBasics</category>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;What is the output of the following code?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;package main&#xA;&#xA;import (&#xA;       &amp;#34;fmt&amp;#34;&#xA;       &amp;#34;time&amp;#34;&#xA;)&#xA;&#xA;func main() {&#xA;       ch1 := make(chan int)&#xA;       go fmt.Println(&amp;lt;-ch1)&#xA;       ch1 &amp;lt;- 5&#xA;       time.Sleep(1 * time.Second)&#xA;}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;A: 5&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;B: Cannot compile&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;C: Runtime deadlock&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;details&gt;&#xA;  &lt;summary&gt;🔑 Answer Analysis:&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;C &lt;a href=&#34;https://go.dev/play/p/FsQsswPtOpp&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;external nofollow noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Run online&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;fatal error: all goroutines are asleep - deadlock!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Official description of &lt;a href=&#34;https://go.dev/ref/spec#Go_statements&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;external nofollow noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Go statements&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A &lt;code&gt;go&lt;/code&gt; statement starts a new goroutine (concurrent thread of execution) and executes a function call in that goroutine.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
